n the human blood fluke, Schistosoma japonicum</article-title><source>Mol Cell Probes</source><year>2006</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>280</fpage><lpage>289</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16647836</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chai</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>McManus</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name><name><surname>McInnes</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Moertel</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Tran</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Loukas</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Gobert</surname><given-names>GN</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Transcriptome profiling of lung schistosomula, <italic>in vitro </italic>cultured schistosomula and adult <italic>Schistosoma japonicum</italic></article-title><source>Cell Mol Life Sci</source><year>2006</year><volume>63</volume><fpage>919</fpage><lpage>929</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16570121</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00018-005-5578-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jolly</surname><given-names>ER</given-names></name><name><surname>Chin</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Bahgat</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lim</surname><given-names>KC</given-names></name><name><surname>DeRisi</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>McKerrow</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gene expression patterns during adaptation of a helminth parasite to different environmental niches</article-title><source>Genome Biol</source><year>2007</yea